:"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Shree Pushkar Chemicals & Fertilisers Limited reported robust financial results for Q2 and H1 FY27, driven by sustained demand and improved business performance across its chemical and fertiliser segments. Management highlighted ongoing and planned strategic capacity expansions, including new capital expenditure at Ratnagiri Unit 5 and fundraising via fully convertible warrants. The company maintains an integrated zero-waste manufacturing model supported by renewable energy initiatives. Shree Pushkar Chemicals & Fertilisers reported Q1 FY27 revenue of Rs. 280.10 crores, representing a 10% year-on-year increase despite lower sales volumes in both the chemical and fertilizer segments due to global supply chain challenges and elevated raw material prices.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects to achieve close to Rs. 1,250 crores turnover with PAT levels near 9% for FY27.","quote":"And the kind of visibility I gave in my last concall that in this particular financial year, the company would be achieving close to Rs. 1,250 crores turnover with the PAT levels of around near to the 9% or so.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the turnover figure could potentially move toward Rs. 1,350 crores or Rs. 1,400 crores.","quote":"Sir still now, If I look at my visibility of Rs. 1,250 crores, that was in account with Units 5 and 6. I wouldn't be surprised if that figure moves toward Rs. 1,350 crores or Rs. 1,400 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"With a full 12 months of operation for Unit 6 next year, management sees the possibility of crossing Rs. 1,700 crores to Rs. 1,750 crores.","quote":"Next year, we will have the full year for Unit 6, whereas this year we only have five or six months. So with a full 12 months, I see the possibility of crossing 1,700 to 1,750.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Revenue growth was supported by sustained demand across both chemical and fertiliser segments.","quote":"During the quarter, Revenue from Operations stood at Rs. 403.5 Cr, registering a robust growth of 58.2% YoY, supported by sustained demand and improved business performance across the Company's Chemical and Fertiliser segments.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"The fertilizer business recorded a sales volume of 66,527 metric tons during Q1 FY27 compared to 76,288 metric tons in Q1 FY26.","quote":"The fertilizer business recorded the sales volume of 66,527 metric tons compared to 76,288 metric tons in Q1 FY26, while volumes in the chemical business were 9,113 metric tons compared to 14,837 metric tons in the corresponding period.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The fertilizer business reported a sales value of Rs. 142 crores, while the chemical business recorded Rs. 138 crores.","quote":"The fertilizer business recorded sales value of Rs. 142 crores, representing growth of 4% year-on-year basis, while the chemical business reported sales value of Rs. 138 crores, grown by 17.10% on year-on-year basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that demand is becoming even more apparent in Q2 as customers absorb increased raw material prices.","quote":"In Q2, the demand is becoming even more apparent. Also, Q1 being the start of the financial year and the beginning of the conflict, people were a bit slow in purchasing as they wanted to wait and see how things behaved.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the company experienced ongoing global supply chain challenges and elevated raw material prices during Q1 FY27.","quote":"During Q1 FY27, the Company reported Revenue from Operations of Rs. 280.1 Cr, registering a growth of 10.0% YoY despite ongoing global supply chain challenges and elevated raw material prices.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"},{"claim":"Sales volumes across both segments were impacted by the prevailing operating environment during the quarter.","quote":"During the quarter, sales volumes across both segments were impacted by the prevailing operating environment.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"},{"claim":"Improved realisations supported higher sales value across both segments despite lower volumes.","quote":"Despite lower volumes, improved realizations supported higher sales value across both segments.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Projects under way at Ratnagiri add 1,50,000 MTPA and 69,000 MTPA capacities across fertilisers and chemicals.","quote":"ProjectsunderwayatRatnagiriUnitsat6andnewProjectatUnit5adding1,50,000MTPAand69,000MTPAcapacitiesacrossFertilisersandChemicals","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"Unit 8 at Meghnagar adds 3,00,000 MTPA capacity for complex fertilisers.","quote":"StrategicgrowthplanatMeghnagarUnit8,adding3,00,000MTPAcapacityfortheComplexFertilisers","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"Units 5 and 6 at Ratnagiri are at an advanced stage of completion.","quote":"At Ratnagiri, Unit 5 and Unit 6 are at the advanced stage of completion, given the continued volatility in raw material prices and availability.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Together, ongoing expansion projects are expected to add 4,50,000 metric tons per annum of fertilizer capacity and 72,000 metric tons per annum of chemical capacity.","quote":"Together, these projects are expected to add 4,50,000 metric tons per annum of fertilizer capacity and 72,000 metric tons per annum of the chemical capacity additionally, significantly expanding the company's manufacturing base.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The company acquired approximately 30,000 square meters of additional land at Lote Parshuram for Rs. 9.33 crores.","quote":"During the quarter, the company acquired approximately 30,000 square meters of additional land at Lote Parshuram for Rs. 9.33 crores, located near the existing Unit 1.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Cumulative capex incurred stands at Rs. 209 crores as of June 30, 2026, against a total planned capex of Rs. 512 crores.","quote":"With this, cumulative capex incurred stands at Rs. 209 crores as of June 30, 2026, against the total planned capex of Rs. 512 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"A 10 megawatt DC solar power project at Nanded is nearing completion.","quote":"The 10 megawatt DC solar power project at Nanded is nearing completion and once commissioned, we will take the company's total installed solar capacity to 20.6 megawatt on DC basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Ratnagiri Unit 5 and Unit 6 are nearing completion.","quote":"Ratnagiri Unit 5 and Unit 6 are nearing completion.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"},{"claim":"The newly acquired land provides additional capacity for development at its existing manufacturing location.","quote":"The land has been acquired to support the Company’s future expansion plans and provides additional capacity for development at its existing manufacturing location.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Q2 FY27 EBITDA margin was approximately 12.0%.","quote":"From a profitability perspective, the Company delivered EBITDA of Rs. 50 Cr with an EBITDA margin of approximately 12.0%, reflecting a growth of 88 YoY.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA increased by 9.7% year-on-year to Rs. 31.9 crores with a margin of 11.4%.","quote":"EBITDA increased by 9.7% year-on-year to Rs. 31.9 crores with a margin of 11.4%, while profit after tax grew by 9.4% to Rs. 22.9 crores with a margin of 8.2%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross profit was Rs. 89.2 crores, registering a growth of 6.3% year-on-year with a margin of 31.9%.","quote":"Gross profit was Rs. 89.2 crores, registering a growth of 6.3% year-on-year with the margin of 31.9%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Sulphur prices increased significantly from the range of USD 250-USD 300 to USD 1,100.","quote":"Specifically, if I talk about sulphur, sulphur, which used to be in the range of USD250-USD300, in today's date, only sulphur is in the range of USD1,100.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"PAT for the quarter was Rs. 22.9 Cr with a margin of 8.2%.","quote":"PAT was Rs. 22.9 Cr compared with Rs. 21.0 Cr in Q1 FY26, registering a growth of 9.4% YoY, with a margin of 8.2%.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company maintains a comfortable liquidity position with Rs. 125 crores in non-lien deposits as of June 30, 2026.","quote":"From a liquidity perspective, the company continues to maintain a comfortable position with Rs. 125 crores in non-lien deposits as on June 30, 2026.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintains Rs. 124.91 Cr in non-lien deposits as on 30th June 2026.","quote":"Maintains Rs. 124.91 Cr in non-lien deposits as on 30th June 2026","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The quarter's performance faced continued challenges around global supply chain and elevated raw material prices.","quote":"The performance was achieved despite continued challenges around global supply chain and elevated raw material prices.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The new chemical plant project at Ratnagiri Unit 5 is expected to be commissioned by March 2028.","quote":"The project is expected to be commissioned by March 2028 and is aimed at catering to the growing demand from customers.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf","timeframe":"March 2028"},{"claim":"The company remains focused on advancing its expansion initiatives, strengthening manufacturing capabilities and increasing capacity across its core businesses as it progresses through FY27.","quote":"As the Company progresses through FY27, it remains focused on advancing its expansion initiatives, strengthening manufacturing capabilities and increasing capacity across its core businesses.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":29,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":15,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}